{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as one of three classes, the Knight, Mage, or Barbarian, in endlessly randomized dungeons. Loot rare gear, master unique abilities, and level up without limits. Need a break from long queues or AFK waits? Whether you\u2019re biding time on company hours or catching up with friends,\u202fJust Keep Looting\u202fdelivers bite\u2011sized dungeon runs you can pause and resume at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/982d6b62c67d2e4db3070160dbf3b52d.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a long queue for a match lobby in another game? <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waiting for friends in your MMO to travel to your location or come back from AFK? <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss makes a dollar, you make a dime? That\u2019s why you <strong>Just Keep Looting on company time</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/f673eade197fe09b0772069e806eea99.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Quick-Play Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jump in for 5\u202fminutes or 5\u202fhours \u2014 your call</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c90dbee9fdb017739e934856c1f3d904.poster.avif?t=1753713510\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c90dbee9fdb017739e934856c1f3d904.webm?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c90dbee9fdb017739e934856c1f3d904.mp4?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in turn-based combat where your decisions make the difference between victory and defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Endless Leveling*</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Farm XP forever! (*up to level 8,200)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c8304851b5048573ac656ccb5d403f6d.poster.avif?t=1753713510\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c8304851b5048573ac656ccb5d403f6d.webm?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/c8304851b5048573ac656ccb5d403f6d.mp4?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch that little bar grow as you defeat enemies and earn experience. Leveling up gives you stat points to allocate and increases your health and mana. Continue leveling forever with no level cap\u2026 sort of. Your character can continue to level as long as you continue earning experience. If you reach level 8,200 you will not be able to earn more experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Turn\u2011Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tactical choice: sword, spell, or brawn.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.poster.avif?t=1753713510\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.webm?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.mp4?t=1753713510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/0db3f6bd716d63f0a791d0aa99a335ff.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stalwart Fighter using Swords and Shields or Greatswords. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/702b0228187bf82011b0ea68608b78ea.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Magickal Adept using Wands and magical Orbs or Staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/1c82aec7544e0f4abb35404bf48dbd60.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Ferocious Warrior using Axes and Hatchets or Battleaxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e\u00a0<strong>Loot Transmogrifier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Trade duplicates for mythic gear.</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/b0e4cfb24792e685fe2226957add2f4e.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude08\u00a0<strong>Boss\u202fKey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hide your dungeon with one tap.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/f180829e9d6569a746f02046dc13d42c.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We get it. Sometimes you don\u2019t want someone else to see that you\u2019re playing a game. Instead of minimizing the game, hit the Boss Key! The screen will change to something more productivity friendly like a web browser with too many tabs open or a spreadsheet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Casual Windowed Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>8:3 aspect ratio fits perfectly beside work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4bca145ca723c4baf27c17c28387e3aa.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave it running while other programs and games are active. During downtime in your other games, fight, level up, and loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/2f6b21e658f88bc7824f674a65e2f627.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by many classic ARPG games, find randomly generated stats on items of different rarity. Find the best ones to maximize your gear and bonuses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up and Improve Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The transmogrifier will happily take your money in exchange for helping you to update the level of your item or replace bonuses to get the ultimate loot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Magical Reforging to upgrade lower rarity items into a single higher rarity item.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and sell items you collect along the way that aren\u2019t useful. Take that money and do something good with it! The store gives you access to random items to supplement what you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shared inventory space between your three characters that lets you transfer items between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4de16fb560a01f14d536e781bcb830eb.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out on your own treasure hunt and collect the rarest and most valuable items. Play at your leisure with no time pressure. Save and close then come back to where you were later. The dungeon is deep, and the loot calls to you, it\u2019s time to <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cMy boss caught me playing and I was so immersed I forgot what the boss key was. I got fired. Now I\u2019m broke and homeless but it was totally worth it!\u201d</i> \u2013 Somebody Somewhere, Probably</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532030?t=1753713510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/0fb5841c938efe9095d91c2ade77bbe3a6c9ad5f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753713510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/3d93c3b557fa7ed3d4e62cc0e166177a2d0cf69b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753713510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/3d93c3b557fa7ed3d4e62cc0e166177a2d0cf69b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753713510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3841230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa