 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shared inventory space between your three characters that lets you transfer items between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4de16fb560a01f14d536e781bcb830eb.avif?t=1753713510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out on your own treasure hunt and collect the rarest and most valuable items. Play at your leisure with no time pressure. Save and close then come back to where you were later. The dungeon is deep, and the loot calls to you, it\u2019s time to <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cMy boss caught me playing and I was so immersed I forgot what the boss key was. I got fired. Now I\u2019m broke and homeless but it was totally worth it!\u201d</i> \u2013 Somebody Somewhere, Probably</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Duck Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/97f17533cb949f612cfa400f36570658c7ea1903/header.jpg?t=1753713510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, any x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156774,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156774/movie480.mp4?t=1751219360","m